In summary, while updating a probability distribution allows a machine to make incremental improvements based on new data, a genuine change of mind represents a much broader and more profound alteration in the machine's conceptual framework and behavioral patterns. Such a capability would mark a significant advancement in artificial intelligence, bridging the gap between reactive systems and those with true adaptive and reflective capacities.

